  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>쥬<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>ᄋᅷ<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>심<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>샬<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Y1H22SMnS5M?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>山盟海誓<rt>산ˉ뼹해ˆ세</rt></ruby> <ruby>란<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>兩人<rt>능랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>咒誓<rt>쥬ˋ좌ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sān-bieng-hâi-se lân-nng-láng u-jiù-joā\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>為怎樣<rt>위좔ˆ율ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>偏偏<rt>폔ˉ폔ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>애<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby>變卦<rt>볜ˋ과</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    wi-joâ̰-yṵ̄ lì phiēn-phiēn-ài-pièn-koa\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>想<rt>슐-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>曉<rt>ᄒᆤˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>哪<rt>나ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"jiâh\">遮<rt>쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>虛華<rt>희ˉ화ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà siṵ-boe-hiàu lì nà e-jiâh-hī-hoâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>欺騙<rt>키ˉ폔</rt></ruby>’<ruby>ᄅᆤ<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>刺激<rt>치ˋ곅</rt></ruby>’둏꽈\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khī-phien’liàu goà chì-kiek&#8217;tioh-goa\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n   <ruby>石頭<rt>죻ᄐᅷˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>爛<rt>놔ˉ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>請<rt>챨ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>애<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby>相信<rt>셩ˉ신</rt></ruby>’꽈\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jioh-tháu e-noā, chiâ̰-lì ài-siōng-sin&#8217;goa\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>最後<rt>줴ˋᄋᅷˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>結果<rt>곋ˆ고ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>也<rt>야-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>較<rt>캏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>縒<rt>좧ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    juè-āu’e kiêt-kò ya-si-bo-khâh-joâh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>凝心<rt>꼥심ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>驚<rt>걀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>酒<rt>쥬ˋ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>厚<rt>ᄀᅷˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>雄雄<rt>형형-</rt></ruby><ruby>一喙<rt>짇취</rt></ruby> <ruby>飲<rt>림ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>焦<rt>다ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gieng-sîm m-kiā̰-jiù kāu, hiong-hiong-jit-chui līm-hor-tâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>上好<rt>셩호ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>醉死<rt>쥐ˋ시ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>매<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby>곻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>活<rt>왛ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siong-hò jùi-sì mài-kôh-oâh\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    앟 <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>醉<rt>쥐</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>醉<rt>쥐</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>醉<rt>쥐</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ah goà bo-jui goà bo-jui bo-jui\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>請<rt>챨ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>免<rt>뼨ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>同情<rt>덩졩ˊ</rt></ruby>’꽈\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chiâ̰-lì m-biên-tong-jiéng&#8217;goa\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>酒<rt>쥬ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>若<rt>나</rt></ruby><ruby>落<rt>롷-</rt></ruby><ruby>喉<rt>ᄋᅷˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>疼<rt>턀ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>入<rt>띱-</rt></ruby><ruby>心肝<rt>심ˉ괄ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jiù na-loh-áu thià̰-rip-sīm-koâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>傷心<rt>셩ˉ심ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>傷心<rt>셩ˉ심ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siōng-sîm’e siōng-sîm’e goà\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>心情<rt>심ˉ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>知影<rt>재ˉ얄ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sīm-jiéng bo-láng e-jāi-yà̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>只<rt>지ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>燒酒<rt>쇼ˉ쥬ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>了解<rt>ᄅᆤˆ개ˋ</rt></ruby>’꽈\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jî-u-siō-jiù liâu-kài&#8217;goa\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>山盟海誓<rt>산ˉ뼹해ˆ세</rt></ruby> <ruby>란<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>兩人<rt>능랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>咒誓<rt>쥬ˋ좌ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sān-bieng-hâi-se lân-nng-láng u-jiù-joā\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>為怎樣<rt>위좔ˆ율ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>偏偏<rt>폔ˉ폔ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>애<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby>變卦<rt>볜ˋ과</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    wi-joâ̰-yṵ̄ lì phiēn-phiēn-ài-pièn-koa\